            "notes": "IMO [Speed Kills](item_2ee0fb37-d15c-4f4c-bac5-26f04794fee9) is the best starting power as it gives attack speed and movement speed.\n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) are must picks. \n\nIts your choice for [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
