            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is the last PURE lifesteal weapon upgrade you can get, so we get it.\n\nDO NOT SELL [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). It gives the same life steal as [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) and only 5% weaker than [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). \n\nYou can choose to sell [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) if you prefer attack speed, but living is more important. The longer you live, the more money you generate.",
