            "notes": "[Precision Targeting](item_13a91b39-de41-4550-9eb1-9a2ebadac940) is good weapon damage and quality of life. With [Cyclic Salvo](item_624ac709-635c-418c-9848-52720e2bba70) you want to constantly be hitting directs, so ammo uptime with [Precision Targeting](item_13a91b39-de41-4550-9eb1-9a2ebadac940) but also a 20% weapon increase also scales with life steal.\n\nThis round again, do NOT SELL [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) as you need to maximize life steal",
