            "created_at": "2025-09-08T07:00:15.837599+00:00",
            "notes": "Finally we unlock [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a). We no longer need the movement speed increase from [Cairo Coolant](item_201118c4-cd0f-43ca-9e7e-51e66be10d9a). \n\nDamage is now more burst related, so we can start subbing some of our life steal for better stats, we finally sell [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). We now choose anything that gives sustain instead.\n\nTesting between the three next purple items as of now (will update later). \n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) for the most raw damage output and execute threshold (if people are living at 1hp)\n\n[Ana's Aim Assist](item_a0296526-119f-454d-a2dc-de4105f12498) for the highest self-sustaining build if dmg is not your concern\n\n[Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) im still testing, seems bad on paper as you do not use any AP in the build, but burst of 25 is nice",
